title: ClickFix Fake Claude Installer C2 Domains (AcSig / Adception)
id: 3f8c1d62-9a47-4e2b-8c15-7d2a6f4b90e1
status: experimental
description: Detects network connections to domains serving fake Claude installers in the Adception malvertising campaign that abuses Bing redirect URLs to deliver the AcSig ClickFix toolkit
references:
  - https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hackers-abuse-google-ads-bing-redirects-to-push-claude-clickfix-attacks/
  - https://fawkes.rocks/2026/10/09/claude-clickfix-attacks-abuse-google-ads-and-bing-redirects/
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026-10-10
tags:
  - attack.resource-development
  - attack.t1583
  - attack.stealth
  - attack.t1036
  - attack.execution
  - attack.t1674
  - attack.t1204
logsource:
  category: network_connection
  product: windows
detection:
  selection:
    dst_domain|endswith:
      - 'claude-desk-code.com'
      - 'cli-desktop.com'
      - 'lake-90.com'
  condition: selection
falsepositives:
  - Unlikely; these domains were staged for the October 2026 campaign. Investigate any hit
level: high
